  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Immortal Crane Sect elders, reviewing Blood Sea Ancestor’s true inheritances, recall the failed pursuit by eight Gu Immortals from Myriad Dragon Dock (five rank six and three rank seven): he killed four, crippled three, and drove one into retreat. Among the four true inheritances then known, they assign him the ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat.",
      "chapters": [
        407
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "char_blood_sea_ancestor",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_myriad_dragon_dock"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later notes the same bat inheritance for himself as a future target, and he thinks of killing Song Zi Xing so that Song Zhong, named as Song Zi Xing’s son and still unborn in the present timeline, will not enter the world.",
      "chapters": [
        408
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_song_zhong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is clothed in a blood red robe. His body is long and sharp like a spear. His face is pale. He has a sharp nose. His gaze is ruthless like that of an eagle or vulture.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is left with a head and half a chest.",
      "chapters": [
        850
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "head-and-chest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a blood pool, only a head and over half his chest remain. His head emerges from the pool.",
      "chapters": [
        862
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "head-and-chest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is already called a demonic path Gu Immortal and a demonic path overlord with a vast demonic reputation.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demonic-reputation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the Central Continent Refinement Path Convention the ten great sects ambush him, and he escapes by first displaying the immortal killer move blood demon body separation, which shocks Central Continent. The move creates a deceptive clone at the cost of a body part and blood path dao marks; after the fight he is left with only a head and half a chest, loses the violent blood dragon bat, and stays out of public view for a long stretch. Fang Yuan also knows that Song Zi Xing’s head is the acknowledgment key for Star Form blessed land’s land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        850
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ambush-and-blood-demon-body-separation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_refinement_path_convention",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Healing in a blood pool with only a head and over half a chest left, he receives the hairy man Gu Immortal Yu Mu Chun, who is already familiar with the place and notes how severe the injuries are.",
      "chapters": [
        862
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "healing-with-yu-mu-chun",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_mu_chun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He shows Yu Mu Chun a blood fetus built from Blood Deity remnant recipes, a Northern Plains blood path technique, and blood demon body separation, meant to produce a second Song Zi Xing if he dies.",
      "chapters": [
        863
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-fetus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_blood_deity",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beside immortal zombie Bo Qing stand Envoy Blue of Shadow Sect, who is immortal zombie Seven Star Child and owner of Starry Sky grotto-heaven; Song Zi Xing, the blood path demonic immortal also known as Blood Dragon; and the hairy man refinement path Gu Immortal Yu Mu Chun. Seven Star Child, Yu Mu Chun, and Song Zi Xing activate an immortal killer move that transports the four of them to Central Continent’s north-east region to attack Heavenly Lotus Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        997
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "joint-operation-with-shadow-sect-figures",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_qing",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "char_seven_star_child",
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "These Shadow Sect Gu Immortals, including Seven Star Child and Song Zi Xing, are Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s split souls. After discussion they enter the ten extreme formation and sacrifice themselves.",
      "chapters": [
        1011
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-sect-and-the-ten-extreme-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Zhong was publicly Song Zi Xing’s son but was created from his blood fetus.",
      "chapters": [
        2084
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-zhong-and-the-blood-fetus",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
